# REQUIRED, with no defaults. Docker Compose sets every one of these for the container.
# Running outside Docker, export them in your shell: uvicorn does not read this file.
#
# Logging verbosity: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING or ERROR.
# LOG_LEVEL=
#
# The services this one calls. A link is a base URL, http://<host>:<port>.
# VALIDATOR_AGENT_URL=
# EXECUTION_AGENT_URL=
# The journal keeps the platforms and the generated pipelines. Asked on every request.
# JOURNAL_URL=
#
# The folder models are picked from.
# GENERATOR_WORKSPACE_DIR=/path/to/your/models
# How Browse names the workspace folder.
# GENERATOR_WORKSPACE_LABEL=/path/to/your/models
